WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.260
What happens to cat spray when&nbsp;
it is placed into SCP-914?

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.560
One bottle of cat spray was&nbsp;
placed into the Clockworks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.960
on the setting "Fine." The output produced was:

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.400
One bottle of "Spray Cat." When used, it produces&nbsp;
a cat with an average age of two years. A wide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.780
range of breeds have been produced so far.&nbsp;
The cats evaporate after around 30 minutes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:29.800
if left alone, and near-instantly if terminated,&nbsp;
making autopsies impossible. Item incinerated.

